                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>Most parameters are within normal limits. However, creatinine is markedly elevated, suggesting impaired renal function, and chloride is mildly increased. These findings may indicate possible renal dysfunction or dehydration. Correlation with clinical status and further nephrological evaluation are recommended.</td>
